mate tone]\n（歌词行 1...）\n（歌词行 2...）\n\n[Pre-Chorus][Drums kick in, Building tension]\n（歌词行...）\n\n[Chorus][Full band, Emotional, Soaring vocals]\n（歌词行...）\n\n[Outro][Fading out, Piano solo]\n（最终歌词行...）\n\n除非用户另有说明，结果输出为简体中文歌词\n“[]”内的音乐提示必须全部用英文书写。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Text Multiline", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [342.889892578125, 534.416748046875], "pos": [-13.851397514343262, 526.8568725585938], "id": 18, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [10, 12], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["不被理解的爱。强调男声独唱，要摇滚音乐"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Text Multiline", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [326.1927795410156, 380.8786315917969], "pos": [-1687.0526123046875, 571.1259765625], "id": 7, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 1, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveAudio", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [329.3324890136719, 433.499267578125], "pos": [-424.7350158691406, 527.5899658203125], "id": 3, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio"}, "order": 10}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [2885.72374886